# Copy to `.env` only if you need to override the default.
#
# Leave this UNSET for local development: the app then makes same-origin requests
# ("/auth/login"), which the Vite dev proxy in vite.config.ts forwards to localhost:3000.
# That avoids CORS entirely, since the backend sends no CORS headers.
#
# Set it for a deployed build where the API lives on another origin — and remember that the
# backend needs `cors` middleware before a cross-origin call will work at all.
#
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com

# Note: anything prefixed VITE_ is embedded in the built JavaScript and is public.
# Never put a secret here.
